/*
  InsightsEngine.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0092 · InsightsEngine (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "InsightsEngine"). The web source
  (web/src/components/data-display/InsightsEngine.tsx) hardcodes its English prose, so every literal
  is extracted here verbatim as the localized value, keyed so translators own word order. These
  entries fold into the app Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they live in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared
  catalog.

  Percent convention: keys resolved via InsightsEngineStrings.format(...) are passed through
  String(format:), so a literal percent is "%%" and substitutions are positional "%n$@". Keys
  resolved via InsightsEngineStrings.string(...) are used as-is, so a literal percent is a single "%".
*/

